  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROGATI - Whole Environment Program - Indigenous Area from head to toe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poor living conditions in isolated regions of Southern Brazil discourage young Guarani people from remaining in their communities for the long term. Associao de Cooperao Tcnica para o Desenvolvimento Humano Outro Olhar (Outro Olhar) provides technical assistance for young Brazilians to learn leadership skills develop microenterprises improve production infrastructure and marketing record oral history and preserve the environment. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Brazil. Outro Olhar&apos;s activities encourage small business growth local entrepreneurship and market development to ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
